OL,3,GNEWSAFlights impacted by air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights across the Channel Islands are
OL,7,Ffacing delays after a technical issue
OL,8,Fwith the UK's air traffic control
OL,9,Fsystems.
OL,11,FNats, which is responsible for the UK's
OL,12,Fair traffic control systems, said on X
OL,13,Fit had identified an issue with its
OL,14,Fflight processing system and that
OL,15,Fflights were still departing and
OL,16,Fairspace was open.
OL,18,FHowever, a number of arrivals from UK
OL,19,Fairports are significantly delayed.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
