OL,3,GNEWSAFlights impacted by air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey Airport said services between
OL,7,Fthe island and UK had been impacted by
OL,8,Fthe issue and that passengers should
OL,9,Fcheck latest information with their
OL,10,Fairline. Guernsey Airport said it was
OL,11,Falso impacted and it would extend its
OL,12,Fopening hours if required.
